1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:03,693
(Q11（单选）) ⭐ come to my talk = 来参加我的讲座

2
00:00:03,693 --> 00:00:06,931
⭐ in the audience = 在观众席；在听众当中

3
00:00:06,931 --> 00:00:15,311
⭐ for those of you who... = 对于你们当中那些……｜background information = 背景信息｜start by doing sth = 首先做某事

4
00:00:15,311 --> 00:00:19,113
⭐ start = 成立；创办（非常见义）

5
00:00:19,113 --> 00:00:30,861
[Q11答案句] ⭐ retail chain = 连锁零售店｜camping equipment = 露营装备｜campsite = 露营地｜offer holidays = 提供度假服务

6
00:00:30,861 --> 00:00:38,370
⭐ grow rapidly = 快速发展｜continental Europe = 欧洲大陆

7
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:44,755
(Q12) ⭐ book a holiday = 预订假期｜have a choice of... = 有……可供选择

8
00:00:44,755 --> 00:00:52,504
⭐ exclusive use of sth = 独家使用某物（C1）

9
00:00:52,504 --> 00:01:00,422
[Q12答案句] ⭐ the majority of... = 大多数……｜expand into... = 拓展到……市场/地区（C1）

10
00:01:00,422 --> 00:01:08,391
⭐ a number of... = 若干；多个｜mountainous region = 山区

11
00:01:08,391 --> 00:01:15,917
⭐ upgrade = 升级｜considerably = 大幅地；相当地（C1）｜star rating = 星级评定

12
00:01:15,917 --> 00:01:20,889
(Q13) ⭐ superb facilities = 一流的设施（C1）

13
00:01:20,889 --> 00:01:30,245
⭐ be occupied = 有事可做；忙于……（C1）｜take advantage of... = 利用；享用（C1）

14
00:01:30,245 --> 00:01:35,067
⭐ well-qualified = 资历优秀的｜enthusiastic = 热情的

15
00:01:35,067 --> 00:01:43,804
⭐ kick off with... = 以……开始（C1）｜be followed by... = 随后是……

16
00:01:43,804 --> 00:01:49,391
⭐ include = 包括｜mime = 默剧（C1）

17
00:01:49,391 --> 00:01:58,558
[Q13答案句] ⭐ art activity = 艺术活动｜poster competition = 海报设计比赛｜model making = 模型制作

18
00:01:58,558 --> 00:02:08,505
(Q14) ⭐ what's more = 此外；而且（B2）｜child-friendly = 对儿童友好的（C1）｜with this in mind = 考虑到这一点（C1）｜operate a no-noise rule = 实行禁止喧哗规定

19
00:02:08,505 --> 00:02:21,745
[Q14答案句] ⭐ be expected to do sth = 被要求做某事｜holiday-maker = 度假者（C1）

20
00:02:21,745 --> 00:02:31,185
(Q15) ⭐ go wrong = 出问题；出故障（高频）｜be insured = 投保；有保险

21
00:02:31,185 --> 00:02:38,657
⭐ annual insurance policy = 年度保险｜take out insurance = 购买保险（C1）｜low-cost cover = 低价保险

22
00:02:38,657 --> 00:02:43,038
[Q15答案句] ⭐ make a reservation = 预订

23
00:02:43,038 --> 00:02:49,087
(Q16) ⭐ advantages to doing sth = 做某事的好处（C1）｜recommend sth to sb = 向某人推荐某物

24
00:02:49,087 --> 00:03:01,113
⭐ regular customer = 老顾客；常客｜keep sb informed of sth = 让某人持续了解……（C1）｜special offer = 优惠活动｜benefit from = 从……中获益（B2）｜for the price of... = 以……的价格

25
00:03:01,113 --> 00:03:09,372
[Q16答案句] ⭐ in return = 作为回报（B2）｜choose from... = 从……中选择｜high-quality items = 高品质物品

26
00:03:09,372 --> 00:03:14,015
(Q17（配对）) ⭐ when it comes to... = 说到……（C1）｜be equipped to a high standard = 按高标准配备

27
00:03:14,015 --> 00:03:24,185
⭐ essential detail = 必要细节｜fuelled by... = 由……供能（C1）｜cooking ring = 炉灶炉圈

28
00:03:24,185 --> 00:03:35,863
⭐ cook indoors = 在室内做饭｜borrow a barbecue = 借用烧烤架｜in advance = 提前（B2）｜make sth available = 提供某物；使某物可供使用（C1）｜picnic blanket = 野餐垫

29
00:03:35,863 --> 00:03:43,352
(Q18) ⭐ can be found = 可以找到（被动表达）｜hire = 租用（英式英语，非常见义）

30
00:03:43,352 --> 00:03:55,957
(Q19) ⭐ spend the day... = 度过一天……｜cool box = 保温箱；冷藏箱（英式英语）｜keep sth chilled = 让某物保持冷藏状态（C1）

31
00:03:55,957 --> 00:04:08,263
(Q20) ⭐ washing facilities = 洗衣设施｜clothes line = 晾衣绳｜along with... = 连同……；以及……（B2）｜mop = 拖把｜bucket = 水桶｜in case... = 以防……（B2）

32
00:04:08,263 --> 00:04:10,763
⭐ eat in = 在家/在住宿地吃饭（对应 eat out）｜would rather...than... = 宁愿……也不……（B2）｜dine at... = 在……用餐（C1）

